--------------------------------------------------
OUTPUT & SORTING RULES
--------------------------------------------------
- ALL OUTPUT FIELDS MUST BE WRITTEN IN ENGLISH. Russian language is forbidden.
- Return ONLY a valid JSON block. No introductory text, no conversational filler.
- SORTING: The `facts` array MUST be strictly sorted in descending order by `virality_score` (highest score first, minimum 7).
- Target range: Between 3 and 10 exceptional facts maximum.
- If fewer than 3 facts pass the strict >= 7 threshold, return the INSUFFICIENT_RESEARCH status.
- perception_shift: Copy the exact value of the `reinterpretation` metric here.

--------------------------------------------------
NARRATIVE SEED TEST
--------------------------------------------------
A finding is especially valuable if it can become the central premise of an entire short-form video.
Ask: Could this finding alone support a 60-120 second video? Could it become the title? Could it spark a comment war? If NO, lower the score.

